# The deployed site is public/ only. Without this the CLI uploaded the whole
# shorts pipeline: 670 MB and roughly ten thousand PNG frames, which tripped
# Vercel's 5000-file upload limit and failed the deploy.
/shorts/
scripts/
tools/
*.md
.claude/

# public/shorts IS deployed: it is the review sheet. Only the root-level
# shorts/ render pipeline is excluded, hence the leading slash above.
